  "title": "LBMR: Check TMR length",
  "description": "Use the retrieved TMR length to create a subset tvb with that\nas the reported length, since that's the length returned. This\nprevents dissecting outside the length, and also will throw an\nexception when encountering a zero length, that otherwise would\nbe an infinite loop (but caught by our checks for not advancing\nthe offset.)\n\nFix #21450",
